{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Delay terminal waiter release until change hooks finish.** Terminal operation futures have already completed when this fatal-propagating hook runs. A resumed handler can therefore execute an at-least-once step while its START is queued; if the hook reports a fatal, the batcher drops that START and replay repeats the side effect. Publish updates and run operation-end/change hooks before completing terminal futures, with a blocked terminal-change regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75uVx8","finding_digest":"2ec144e6d7922e9aa3a8e7041782be2f4faa8c07697c1c489710a29503fe727c","finding_id":"arf_v1_f3aujzwxsixjvi5i44cbpav6f5","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::oncheckpointcomplete::operation-change-fatal-after-waiter-release","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::oncheckpointcomplete::operation-change-fatal-after-waiter-release","line":279,"observation_digest":"c9d1acf17be263615184e038774ae238684b29cc07cbd1bfa5e60d9c81641426","observation_id":"aro_v1_zhi2z4l34jrwcume4a4hosxchb","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_f3aujzwxsixjvi5i44cbpav6f5","published_at":"2026-10-05T22:49:53Z","review_id":"arr_v1_kfsnri6wu5y4d2bfhsye4jqsyn","reviewed_base_sha":"6045c38025275782197b771642129532058b8ccb","reviewed_head_sha":"189189e3465c03d341333907ed55587b989c9eb4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":278,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_gwgcvzh6a7d4z3qepjodttvkrv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T22:49:53Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
